    """M of export_signed_stage_verifier / verify_signed_stage_verifier.

    ``D || 0x01 || U(stage) || B(UTF-8(hash_name)) || B(key)``
    with ``D = b"auditchain/signed-stage/v1\\0"``, ``U`` an unsigned
    8-byte big-endian integer and ``B(x) = U(len(x)) || x``.
    """

